# Request the perception node load (and make active) the model for a task.
# Resolves to <model_dir>/<model>.{engine|onnx}, where <model> is the task unless
# sub_vision's model_manager.TASK_MODELS maps it to another file. If the task is
# already the active model this is a no-op that still returns success; if the
# load fails, the previous model stays active.
string task
---
bool success
string message        # human-readable status / error
string active_model    # model now resident, "<task> (<backend>)"; "" if none
float32 load_time_s    # wall-clock time spent loading/building, 0 on no-op
